  "summary": "点击卡片就在原地撑开露出详情，下面的卡片被顺势挤开，再点一次收起复原。",
  "usage": "信息流里就地看详情、不想打断浏览的场景（消息流、卡片列表、折叠面板）；展开内容 2–5 行。",
  "caution": "展开内容超过一屏要改成独立页或弹窗；同屏多张卡片同时展开会撑得很长；列表长时用虚拟滚动，否则重排开销大。",
  "hint": "点卡片原地撑开，再点收起",
  "prompt": "【卡片原地展开】目标：**单列纵向列表**里点一张卡片，它原地往下撑开露出详情，下面的卡片被整体推下去（挤压感）；再点收起复原。\n\n1) 布局必须是**单列纵向**：`.list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}`。用网格（2 列 + 跨列）会变成「换行重排」，视觉上是跳位而不是挤压——这是实测被指出来的问题。\n\n2) 展开：卡片 `.open` 时 `.detail{max-height:90px; opacity:1}`；收起 `max-height:0; opacity:0`。高度变化驱动下面的卡片被推下去。\n\n3) **位移补间**：切换前后各记录一次所有 item 的 `getBoundingClientRect().top`，`delta = before - after`，对每个 item 调 `el.animate([{transform:translateY(delta px)},{transform:none}], 300ms, cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.3,1))`。没有这一步，下面的卡片会瞬移。\n\n4) FLIP 记录用 `{el, top}` 数组，**别用 DOM 元素当对象 key**。\n\n5) 交互：点卡片 toggle；同屏只展开一张（点另一张先收起旧的）；Enter/Space 也支持。\n\n6) 视觉：展开态品牌色边框 + 5% 淡底，圆点从半透明变实色；详情文字缩进对齐标题（padding-left 26px）。\n\n7) 坑：`max-height` 过渡与 FLIP 同时进行时，下面的卡片位移是 FLIP 算的、展开项自己的高度是 CSS 过渡的，两者必须都用同一条缓动，否则会有「先动一下又追上来」的错位感。\n\n8) 配色：展开态 var(--ui-brand)。\n\n9) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（点第一张 → 撑开、下面两张下滑 → 停 1.5 秒 → 收起）；弹窗里只绑真实点击。\n\n10) 使用场景：信息流/列表就地看详情；内容超一屏改独立页；同屏别开多个。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}\n\n/* 单列纵向排列：展开一张，下面的卡片被整体挤下去，这就是「挤压」而不是「重排」 */\n.list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;width:100%;max-width:340px}\n\n.item{border-radius:11px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  cursor:pointer;user-select:none;overflow:hidden;\n  transition:border-color .2s ease,background .2s ease}\n.item:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,var(--ui-border))}\n.item.open{border-color:var(--ui-brand);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 5%,var(--ui-surface))}\n\n.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 11px;min-width:0}\n.row .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 auto;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,transparent);transition:background .2s ease}\n.item.open .row .dot{background:var(--ui-brand)}\n.row b{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;min-width:0}\n.row small{margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);flex:0 0 auto}\n\n.detail{max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;\n  transition:max-height .3s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.3,1),opacity .22s ease}\n.item.open .detail{max-height:90px;opacity:1}\n.detail p{margin:0;padding:0 11px 10px 26px;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:12px}\n  .list{gap:5px;max-width:320px}\n  .item{border-radius:9px}\n  .row{padding:6px 9px;gap:6px}\n  .row b{font-size:10px}\n  .row small{font-size:8px}\n  .detail p{font-size:9.5px;padding:0 9px 8px 22px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .item,.detail,.row .dot{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"list\" id=\"list\">\n  <div class=\"item\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <div class=\"row\"><i class=\"dot\"></i><b>设计系统</b><small>12</small></div>\n    <div class=\"detail\"><p>展开时这张卡片往下撑开，下面的卡片被整体推下去——单列布局才看得出「挤压」，网格换行看起来像重排。</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"item\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <div class=\"row\"><i class=\"dot\"></i><b>动效规范</b><small>8</small></div>\n    <div class=\"detail\"><p>被挤开的卡片用 FLIP 补位移，位移是连续的；如果只靠布局重排，它们会瞬间跳位。</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"item\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <div class=\"row\"><i class=\"dot\"></i><b>色彩方案</b><small>3</small></div>\n    <div class=\"detail\"><p>同屏只展开一张，避免整个列表被撑得太长。</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var list = document.getElementById('list');\n  var items = [].slice.call(list.querySelectorAll('.item'));\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function snapshot(){\n    return items.map(function(el){ return { el: el, top: el.getBoundingClientRect().top }; });\n  }\n\n  function toggle(item){\n    var before = snapshot();\n    var willOpen = !item.classList.contains('open');\n\n    items.forEach(function(it){\n      it.classList.remove('open');\n      it.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n      var d = it.querySelector('.detail');\n      if(d) d.style.maxHeight = '';\n    });\n    if(willOpen){\n      item.classList.add('open');\n      item.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');\n    }\n\n    var after = snapshot();\n    before.forEach(function(b){\n      var a = null;\n      for(var i = 0; i < after.length; i++){ if(after[i].el === b.el){ a = after[i]; break; } }\n      if(!a) return;\n      var delta = b.top - a.top;\n      if(Math.abs(delta) < 0.5) return;\n      b.el.animate([\n        { transform: 'translateY(' + delta + 'px)' },\n        { transform: 'none' }\n      ], { duration: 300, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.3,1)' });\n    });\n  }\n\n  items.forEach(function(item){\n    item.addEventListener('click', function(){ toggle(item); });\n    item.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n      if(e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' '){ e.preventDefault(); toggle(item); }\n    });\n  });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    items.forEach(function(it){ it.classList.remove('open'); it.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false'); });\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.moveTo(items[0]);\n\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.release();\n        toggle(items[0]);\n        setTimeout(function(){\n          c.press();\n          setTimeout(function(){\n            c.release();\n            toggle(items[0]);\n            if(c.hide) c.hide();\n          }, 170);\n        }, 1500);\n      }, 160);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 4400); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
